      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LADY NESS (4) crossed over from out wide last start before finishing third (39.02) at this track in a R/A FIN over 660m. Can measure up this time. ARCHER SWEET (1) turned in a better effort at Traralgon last start, finishing third behind Parabola (33.78) in a Rank Limit - Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. Expected to be in this for a long way. PAW XEROX (8) rises 115m in distance at his first attempt over the longer trip. Missed the frame last time when 4th and beaten 7 lengths (31.47) at this track. Can hit the frame with the right run. RAPIDO SPIRIT (2) cannot be left out despite racing here for the first time.",
